Package: mvapp
Title: Analysis Backend for MVApp 2.0
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Magdalena", "Julkowska", email = "magdalena.m.julkowska@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pure, testable analysis functions that power the MVApp Shiny
    application: data curation, PhenoSight ingestion (PS2 / RGB / watering),
    multivariate statistics, and machine-learning / path-analysis
    explainability. The Shiny app is a thin UI on top of these functions, so
    the same code runs in the app, in lab RMarkdown notebooks, and in tests.
